#: luci-app-axonhub/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/axonhub.js:265
msgid ""
"Changing this path starts a separate instance unless the existing database "
"is moved while AxonHub is stopped."
msgstr ""
"修改此路径会创建一个全新实例；如需保留数据，请先停止 AxonHub，再移动现有数据"
"库。"

#: luci-app-axonhub/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/axonhub.js:340
msgid ""
"Clean up expired requests, usage records and stored payloads according to "
"the retention policy in AxonHub. Daily cleanup runs at 02:00 UTC; hourly "
"cleanup runs on the hour."
msgstr ""
"按 AxonHub 中的保留策略清理过期请求、用量记录和正文文件。每天在 UTC 02:00（北"
"京时间 10:00）运行，每小时在整点运行。"

#: luci-app-axonhub/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/axonhub.js:330
msgid ""
"Clear the dedicated AxonHub log at 03:00 on the selected calendar schedule. "
"System log entries are never cleared."
msgstr "按所选日历计划在 03:00 清理 AxonHub 独立日志，不会清理系统日志。"

